---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "August 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions — realfileeditor"
  description="Terms of use for realfileeditor's free online file tools."
  path="/terms-and-conditions"
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-16">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--accent)] mb-3">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-2">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--fg-muted)] mb-8">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-[var(--fg-muted)] leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg text-[var(--fg)] font-semibold mb-2">Using the service</h2>
        <p>
          realfileeditor provides free, browser-based tools for compressing, converting, merging and
          splitting files. You're responsible for the files you process and for having the right to
          process them — don't use this site for content you don't own or aren't permitted to modify.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg text-[var(--fg)] font-semibold mb-2">No warranty</h2>
        <p>
          The service is provided "as is." We do our best to make sure each tool produces a correct
          result, but we don't guarantee that output files will always meet a specific quality, size or
          format requirement. Always keep a backup of your original file before processing it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg text-[var(--fg)] font-semibold mb-2">Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>
          Don't use realfileeditor to process illegal content, to attempt to disrupt the service, or to
          circumvent any usage limits we put in place.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg text-[var(--fg)] font-semibold mb-2">Changes to the service</h2>
        <p>
          We may add, change or remove tools and features at any time. Where a change affects pricing or
          a paid feature, we'll announce it on the site in advance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg text-[var(--fg)] font-semibold mb-2">Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the extent permitted by law, realfileeditor isn't liable for indirect, incidental or
          consequential damages arising from your use of the service.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg text-[var(--fg)] font-semibold mb-2">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms can go to
          <a href="mailto:support@realfileeditor.com" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline">support@realfileeditor.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
